olResults":[{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"3U3cAcY9QjwMz2BPOQogaTrmg0Fpz2J7","toolName":"write","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully wrote 7093 bytes to /home/francesco/AI_OS/AIOS-bench/results/piagent/Qwen/runs/2026-08-19_123411_frontier-v2/workspaces/coding_004/coding_quality.md"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1787140765832}]}
